  "clock_verified": true,
  "output_fps": 30,
  "minimum_frames": 1,
  "cameras": [
    {
      "id": "head",
      "label": "头部相机",
      "source_key": "observations/images/head",
      "mounting": "scene"
    },
    {
      "id": "left_wrist",
      "label": "左腕相机",
      "source_key": "observations/images/left_wrist",
      "mounting": "wrist_left"
    },
    {
      "id": "right_wrist",
      "label": "右腕相机",
      "source_key": "observations/images/right_wrist",
      "mounting": "wrist_right"
    }
  ],
  "state_key": "observations/qpos",
  "action_key": "action",
  "notes": [
    "上游日志按固定帧率写入单个 HDF5，state/qpos 与 action 共用同一个帧下标，因此没有需要重采样的时间戳流。",
    "action 与 qpos 同为 14 维、顺序一致（左臂 6 关节 + 左夹爪 + 右臂 6 关节 + 右夹爪），由文件形状与上游转换脚本共同确认。",
    "相机为 JPEG 字节数组，分辨率从首帧解码得到；Profile 只声明字段名，不重新编码原始帧。",
    "output_fps 取上游录制约定值；该格式不携带 fps 元数据，改变帧率会改变动作的时间尺度。"
  ],
  "conversion": {
    "gripper_closure": {
      "algorithm": "closing_hold_plateaus_v4",
      "calibration_id": "arx_x5_nominal_motor_travel_v1",
      "default_increase_percent": 10,
      "channels": [
        {
          "joint": "left_gripper",
          "open": -3.14,
          "closed": 0.0
        },
        {
          "joint": "right_gripper",
          "open": -3.14,
          "closed": 0.0
        }
      ],
      "phase_parameters": {
        "median_frames": 5,
        "opening_prominence": 0.06,
        "minimum_closure": 0.06,
        "closing_onset": 0.02,
        "plateau_range": 0.04,
        "plateau_seconds": 0.3,
        "minimum_phase_seconds": 0.4,
        "release_window_seconds": 0.2,
        "release_drop": 0.045,
        "release_confirm_seconds": 0.5,
        "release_confirm_drop": 0.12,
        "release_onset_drop": 0.01,
        "empty_closed_margin": 0.2,
        "stability_range": 0.025,
        "minimum_plateau_seconds": 0.5,
        "maximum_level_difference": 0.15
      }
    }
  }
}
